    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.1.7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Silete a facie Domini Dei, quia juxta est dies Domini: quia præparavit Dominus hostiam; sanctificavit vocatos suos.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.1.8",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.1.8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et erit: in die hostiæ Domini, visitabo super principes, et super filios regis, et super omnes qui induti sunt veste peregrina;",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.1.9",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.1.9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et visitabo super omnem qui arroganter ingreditur super limen in die illa, qui complent domum Domini Dei sui iniquitate et dolo.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
