    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.1.10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et erit in die illa, dicit Dominus, vox clamoris a porta piscium, et ululatus a Secunda, et contritio magna a collibus.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.1.11",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.1.11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ululate, habitatores Pilæ: conticuit omnis populus Chanaan, disperierunt omnes involuti argento.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.1.12",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.1.12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et erit in tempore illo: scrutabor Jerusalem in lucernis, et visitabo super viros defixos in fæcibus suis, qui dicunt in cordibus suis: Non faciet bene Dominus, et non faciet male.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.1.13",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.1.13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et erit fortitudo eorum in direptionem, et domus eorum in desertum: et ædificabunt domos, et non habitabunt; et plantabunt vineas, et non bibent vinum earum.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.1.14",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.1.14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Juxta est dies Domini magnus: juxta est, et velox nimis. Vox diei Domini amara: tribulabitur ibi fortis.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.1.15",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.1.15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Dies iræ dies illa, dies tribulationis et angustiæ, dies calamitatis et miseriæ, dies tenebrarum et caliginis, dies nebulæ et turbinis,",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.1.16",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.1.16",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "dies tubæ et clangoris super civitates munitas, et super angulos excelsos.",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.1.17",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.1.17",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et tribulabo homines, et ambulabunt ut cæci, quia Domino peccaverunt; et effundetur sanguis eorum sicut humus, et corpora eorum sicut stercora.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.1.18",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.1.18",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed et argentum eorum et aurum eorum non poterit liberare eos in die iræ Domini: in igne zeli ejus devorabitur omnis terra, quia consummationem cum festinatione faciet cunctis habitantibus terram.]",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.2.1",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.2.1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "[Convenite, congregamini, gens non amabilis,",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
