    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.2.2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "priusquam pariat jussio quasi pulverem transeuntem diem, antequam veniat super vos ira furoris Domini, antequam veniat super vos dies indignationis Domini.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.2.3",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.2.3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quærite Dominum, omnes mansueti terræ, qui judicium ejus estis operati; quærite justum, quærite mansuetum, si quomodo abscondamini in die furoris Domini.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.2.4",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.2.4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quia Gaza destructa erit, et Ascalon in desertum: Azotum in meridie ejicient, et Accaron eradicabitur.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.2.5",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.2.5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Væ qui habitatis funiculum maris, gens perditorum ! verbum Domini super vos, Chanaan, terra Philisthinorum; et disperdam te, ita ut non sit inhabitator.",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.2.6",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.2.6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et erit funiculus maris requies pastorum, et caulæ pecorum;",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.2.7",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.2.7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et erit funiculus ejus qui remanserit de domo Juda: ibi pascentur, in domibus Ascalonis ad vesperam requiescent, quia visitabit eos Dominus Deus eorum, et avertet captivitatem eorum.",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.2.8",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.2.8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Audivi opprobrium Moab, et blasphemias filiorum Ammon, quæ exprobraverunt populo meo, et magnificati sunt super terminos eorum.",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.2.9",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.2.9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Propterea vivo ego, dicit Dominus exercituum, Deus Israël, quia Moab ut Sodoma erit, et filii Ammon quasi Gomorrha: siccitas spinarum, et acervi salis, et desertum usque in æternum: reliquiæ populi mei diripient eos, et residui gentis meæ possidebunt illos.",
    "chunk_index": 26,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.2.10",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.2.10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Hoc eis eveniet pro superbia sua, quia blasphemaverunt et magnificati sunt super populum Domini exercituum.",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.2.11",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.2.11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Horribilis Dominus super eos, et attenuabit omnes deos terræ: et adorabunt eum viri de loco suo, omnes insulæ gentium.",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.2.12",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.2.12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed et vos, Æthiopes, interfecti gladio meo eritis.",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.2.13",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.2.13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et extendet manum suam super aquilonem, et perdet Assur, et ponet speciosam in solitudinem, et in invium, et quasi desertum.",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.2.14",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.2.14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et accubabunt in medio ejus greges, omnes bestiæ gentium; et onocrotalus et ericius in liminibus ejus morabuntur: vox cantantis in fenestra, corvus in superliminari, quoniam attenuabo robur ejus.",
    "chunk_index": 31,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.2.15",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.2.15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Hæc est civitas gloriosa habitans in confidentia, quæ dicebat in corde suo: Ego sum, et extra me non est alia amplius: quomodo facta est in desertum cubile bestiæ? omnis qui transit per eam sibilabit, et movebit manum suam.]",
    "chunk_index": 32,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/zeph#Zeph.3.1",
    "work_id": "clementine/zeph",
    "canonical_ref": "Zeph.3.1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "[Væ provocatrix, et redempta civitas, columba !",
    "chunk_index": 33,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
